/-!
# Shared exact interval Jacobian for the 22-dimensional certificate

The kernel verifies every matrix entry against the original automatic differentiation
evaluator. Matrix row bounds can then reuse the certified entries.
-/

public section
namespace GerverSofa.PartALeanCert
open LeanCert.Core LeanCert.Engine

/-- Reconstruct a natural number from base-10³⁵ chunks for decimal elaboration. -/
def naturalFromChunks (chunks : List ℕ) : ℕ :=
  chunks.foldl (fun value digit => value * 10 ^ 35 + digit) 0

/-- Exact cached Jacobian interval number 0, shared by equal entries. -/
